{"kind": "coverage", "sut": "BackgroundRecorder", "sut_file": "Source/Parsek/BackgroundRecorder.cs", "sut_line": 6742, "case_kind": "mirror-direction", "proposed_name": "ClassifyBackgroundRelativeFrameContract_GhostCandidateWithCurrentCandidate_IsRecorded", "sketch": "Call ClassifyBackgroundRelativeFrameContract with an unrecognized sourceLabel (e.g. ghost-candidate), AnchorCandidateSource.Ghost, hasCurrentAnchorCandidate: true, activeReFlyParentMatch: false, hasPreReFlyAnchorSnapshot: false; expect recorded. Mirror row with AnchorCandidateSource.Live expects live.", "guards": "The trailing source-dispatch ternary is the one branch no committed cell reaches; flipping it today keeps every existing cell green while background Relative frames would carry the wrong anchor contract label.", "risk": "recording"}
